Subject: [PATCH] toolkit: portal and MPRIS app IDs claim org.aequera, never org.mozilla

Why Firefox source must change:
  Two freedesktop app IDs are string literals in widget/gtk with no build
  option, branding, or preference redirect: the xdg-desktop-portal Register
  call (WidgetUtilsGtk.cpp) passes org.mozilla.firefox, and the MPRIS media
  key service owns org.mpris.MediaPlayer2.firefox. Left as-is, an Aequera
  Linux build registers portal permissions under Mozilla's app ID and
  advertises media players as Firefox.

What it changes:
  - widget/gtk/WidgetUtilsGtk.cpp: portal Register app ID
    org.mozilla.firefox -> org.aequera.browser, matching the shipped
    org.aequera.browser.desktop entry (portals scope permissions by this
    ID; configs/defaults/branding.toml dbus_service names the same value).
  - widget/gtk/MPRISServiceHandler.h: MPRIS service/track suffix .firefox
    -> .aequera. The org.mpris.MediaPlayer2 prefix is the shared standard
    and stays; only our leaf changes.

Depends on: 0001 (same series; independent hunks, applies alone too).
Validation: aequera patch check (applies cleanly); Linux build + run:
  portal file chooser works, busctl shows the Aequera IDs, media keys route
  to org.mpris.MediaPlayer2.aequera.
Upstream risk: low. Two literals in stable desktop-integration code.

diff --git a/widget/gtk/MPRISServiceHandler.h b/widget/gtk/MPRISServiceHandler.h
index b4dbf1989335..83f0934a4aee 100644
--- a/widget/gtk/MPRISServiceHandler.h
+++ b/widget/gtk/MPRISServiceHandler.h
@@ -13,11 +13,11 @@
 #include "nsMimeTypes.h"
 #include "nsString.h"
 
-#define DBUS_MPRIS_SERVICE_NAME "org.mpris.MediaPlayer2.firefox"
+#define DBUS_MPRIS_SERVICE_NAME "org.mpris.MediaPlayer2.aequera"
 #define DBUS_MPRIS_OBJECT_PATH "/org/mpris/MediaPlayer2"
 #define DBUS_MPRIS_INTERFACE "org.mpris.MediaPlayer2"
 #define DBUS_MPRIS_PLAYER_INTERFACE "org.mpris.MediaPlayer2.Player"
-#define DBUS_MPRIS_TRACK_PATH "/org/mpris/MediaPlayer2/firefox"
+#define DBUS_MPRIS_TRACK_PATH "/org/mpris/MediaPlayer2/aequera"
 
 namespace mozilla {
 namespace widget {
diff --git a/widget/gtk/WidgetUtilsGtk.cpp b/widget/gtk/WidgetUtilsGtk.cpp
index c1474f74fa68..b59c1a524979 100644
--- a/widget/gtk/WidgetUtilsGtk.cpp
+++ b/widget/gtk/WidgetUtilsGtk.cpp
@@ -200,7 +200,9 @@ static void DoRegisterHostApp() {
 
   GVariantBuilder builder;
   g_variant_builder_init(&builder, G_VARIANT_TYPE("(sa{sv})"));
-  g_variant_builder_add(&builder, "s", "org.mozilla.firefox");
+  // Aequera: portal app ID matches the shipped desktop entry
+  // (org.aequera.browser.desktop), so portal permissions scope to us.
+  g_variant_builder_add(&builder, "s", "org.aequera.browser");
   GVariantBuilder dict_builder;
   g_variant_builder_init(&dict_builder, G_VARIANT_TYPE("a{sv}"));
   g_variant_builder_add_value(&builder, g_variant_builder_end(&dict_builder));
